{{ 'ka-collection-cross-link.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- comment -%}
  K&A Collection Cross-Link Strip ("The Other Collections")
  Spec: Docs/collection-build-spec.md, Section 2 ("Section 9 — Cross-Link Strip"), F8, CD Note 5.
  Keeps the Maison feeling continuous — a visitor on one collection should see the
  other three waiting. Per F8, given exactly four named capsule collections today,
  the simpler fixed-four-with-filter approach is appropriate (not a "related
  products" recommendation engine — see CD Note 5, resist ever making this
  algorithmic). Stable order mirrors the homepage Collections Directory exactly:
  Festive Edit, Bloom Soirée, Chamakk, Barre Oblique.

  Platform-compatibility fix: originally built with four "type": "collection"
  picker settings, but Shopify's collection-picker setting type has no documented
  JSON value format for direct template authoring — it's editor-managed, not
  meant to be pre-populated by hand in a JSON template (confirmed via
  shopify.dev). The homepage's ka-collections-directory.liquid already worked
  around this same limitation with a manual card_url fallback. Since this list
  is already fixed/manually-maintained by design (F8 — a 5th collection needs a
  manual code update regardless), the picker setting added an unreliable layer
  of indirection for no benefit. Replaced with a direct `collections['handle']`
  Liquid lookup — stable, fully documented, no schema setting or JSON wiring
  needed. If a fifth named collection is added later, update cl_handles below —
  acceptable for now per F8, revisit only past ~6 collections.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  2026-10-20 (category pages) -- ring order + silhouette mode.

  CAPSULE RING: one ordered, hand-maintained list of capsule handles. On a
  capsule page the strip shows the three that follow the current one,
  wrapping around, so every capsule gets equal cross-link exposure and the
  strip is always exactly three cards (no orphan fourth card). On any page
  that is not in the ring (Signature, Wedding Festive, the silhouettes) it
  shows the first three. Still a fixed list on purpose (CD Note 5), never an
  algorithm.
  LOOMIERE: not launched. When it launches, put `loomiere` FIRST in
  cl_capsule_handles below (newest first) -- nothing else changes.

  SILHOUETTE MODE: on lehengas / drapes / indo-western / corsets the strip
  shows the other three silhouettes (eyebrow/title swap), and the closing
  line links back to /collections. Capsule pages get the closing line
  linking to the four silhouettes instead.

  Images: collection metafield custom.hero_image, then collection.image,
  then per-handle placeholder assets.
{%- endcomment -%}

{% liquid
  assign cl_capsule_handles = "first-love|the-festive-edit|the-bloom-soiree|chamak|barre-oblique" | split: "|"
  assign cl_silhouette_handles = "lehengas|drapes|indo-western|corsets" | split: "|"

  assign cl_is_silhouette = false
  if cl_silhouette_handles contains collection.handle
    assign cl_is_silhouette = true
  endif

  assign cl_picked = ''
  if cl_is_silhouette
    for h in cl_silhouette_handles
      if h != collection.handle
        assign cl_picked = cl_picked | append: h | append: '|'
      endif
    endfor
  else
    assign cl_size = cl_capsule_handles.size
    assign cl_idx = -1
    for h in cl_capsule_handles
      if h == collection.handle
        assign cl_idx = forloop.index0
      endif
    endfor
    assign cl_start = cl_idx | plus: 1
    for n in (0..2)
      assign cl_pos = cl_start | plus: n | modulo: cl_size
      assign cl_picked = cl_picked | append: cl_capsule_handles[cl_pos] | append: '|'
    endfor
  endif
  assign cl_handles = cl_picked | split: '|'
%}

<section class="ka-cross-link" aria-label="{% if cl_is_silhouette %}The other silhouettes{% else %}The other collections{% endif %}">
  <div class="ka-cross-link__inner">
    <div class="ka-cross-link__header reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--on-dark ka-cross-link__eyebrow">Continue Through the Maison</p>
      <h2 class="ka-cross-link__title">{% if cl_is_silhouette %}The Other Silhouettes{% else %}The Other Collections{% endif %}</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ka-cross-link__grid">
      {% assign delay = 0 %}
      {% for h in cl_handles %}
        {% assign cl_collection = collections[h] %}
        {% if cl_collection != blank and cl_collection.handle != collection.handle %}
          {% assign delay = delay | plus: 1 %}
          {%- assign cl_mf_image = cl_collection.metafields.custom.hero_image.value -%}
          <a href="{{ cl_collection.url }}" class="ka-cl-card reveal-img{% if delay > 1 %} reveal-delay-{{ delay | minus: 1 }}{% endif %}">
            <div class="ka-cl-card__image">
              {% if cl_mf_image != blank %}
                {%- assign cl_mf_focus = cl_collection.metafields.custom.hero_focus.value | strip | escape -%}
                <img
                  src="{{ cl_mf_image | image_url: width: 900 }}"
                  alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="900"
                  height="675"
                  class="img-filter-coll-page-dark"
                  {% if cl_mf_focus != blank %}style="object-position: {{ cl_mf_focus }};"{% endif %}
                />
              {% elsif cl_collection.handle == 'the-festive-edit' %}
                <img src="{{ 'festive-edit-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="675" class="img-filter-coll-page-dark" style="object-position: 50% 12%;" />
              {% elsif cl_collection.image != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ cl_collection.image | image_url: width: 900 }}"
                  alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="900"
                  height="675"
                  class="img-filter-coll-page-dark"
                />
              {% else %}
                {%- assign cl_handle_lower = cl_collection.handle | downcase -%}
                {%- case cl_handle_lower -%}
                  {%- when 'first-love' -%}
                    <img src="{{ 'first-love-card.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="675" class="img-filter-coll-page-dark" />
                  {%- when 'the-bloom-soiree' -%}
                    <img src="{{ 'bloom-soiree-main.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="675" class="img-filter-coll-page-dark" />
                  {%- when 'the-festive-edit' -%}
                    <img src="{{ 'festive-edit-hero.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="675" class="img-filter-coll-page-dark" style="object-position: 50% 12%;" />
                  {%- when 'chamak' -%}
                    <img src="{{ 'collection-secondary-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="675" class="img-filter-coll-page-dark" />
                  {%- when 'barre-oblique' -%}
                    <img src="{{ 'collection-secondary-2.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="{{ cl_collection.title }}" loading="lazy" width="900" height="675" class="img-filter-coll-page-dark" />
                  {%- else -%}
                    <div style="background: var(--c-charcoal-2); width:100%; height:100%;"></div>
                {%- endcase -%}
              {% endif %}
            </div>
            <div class="ka-cl-card__overlay"></div>
            <div class="ka-cl-card__label">
              <p class="ka-cl-card__name">{{ cl_collection.title }}</p>
              <span class="ka-cl-card__arrow">Explore &rarr;</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="ka-cross-link__more reveal">
      {%- if cl_is_silhouette -%}
        <a href="/collections">Or explore the capsule collections</a>
      {%- else -%}
        Or shop by silhouette:
        <a href="/collections/lehengas">Lehengas</a><span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span><a href="/collections/drapes">Drape Sarees</a><span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span><a href="/collections/indo-western">Indo-Western</a><span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span><a href="/collections/corsets">Corsets</a>
      {%- endif -%}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Collection Cross-Link",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "ka-collection-cross-link-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The cross-linked collections are fixed in code by handle, not editable here — see the comment at the top of this section's .liquid file. On capsule pages the next three capsules in a ring are shown; on silhouette pages the other three silhouettes."
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "Collection Cross-Link" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
